WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:01.940
I'm sorry!

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.960
Due to the backlash experienced
 during pair annihilation,

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.450
your Gears require maintenance.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:10.070
It's fine.

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:12.760
If anything, you did a great job 
with the little time you had.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:13.950
Thank you.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:17.980
Thanks to you, we were able to get over
 a problem we really didn't need.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:22.490
I'll hurry and remove the corruption
 caused by the backlash.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.010
It's good to have you around, shrimp.

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:27.900
Chris-san, you're also...

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:29.890
I'm big!

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:39.060
Match my breathing!

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.840
Tsukuyomi!

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:42.070
It's too fast!

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.050
Are you okay?

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:52.550
If it were Kiri-chan, 
I could keep up with her...

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:37.510
<b>Episode 9
Blue Bunny</b>

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:37.970
So even with Tsubasa guiding her, 
Shirabe-kun can't keep up, huh?

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:47.970
Even if I keep doing this exercise...

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:52.030
Ogawa-san?

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:55.780
I'll help you in my own small way.

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:59.670
That technique originated 
with the Hida Ninja Army.

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:02.900
If we don't work together, we won't 
even be able to touch his shadow!

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:04.870
Shirabe!

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:08.380
Outrace him with your agility!

00:03:08.380 --> 00:03:09.340
Okay!

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:14.120
I hope you can go easy on me...

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:32.060
<i>Slashin' genocide, spiky spinning sounds</i>

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:35.510
<i>You can cry but I won't stop</i>

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:37.510
You're wide open!

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:40.020
<i>Don't mess with me...</i>

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:41.030
No way!

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:43.780
I'm right here.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:47.020
<i>the most painful, understand?</i>

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:50.030
You can't catch up to me 
by just running after me!

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:54.380
<i>For some reason my heart 
refuses to synchronize</i>

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:51.530
Don't rush into things, Tsukuyomi!

00:03:54.380 --> 00:04:01.980
<i>but there's a warm melody of love 
that's just for the two of us</i>

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:57.990
<i>Kiri-chan can do it, 
no matter who she pairs with.</i>

00:03:57.990 --> 00:04:00.720
<i>But I need her...</i>

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:04.340
<i>I have to be able to fight on my own!</i>

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:07.740
<i>The moon can never...</i>

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:05.940
Let's work together, Tsukuyomi!

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:07.740
We need to pin him down!

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:09.440
Then, I'll use an area attack!

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:10.600
I won't let him get away!

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:14.170
<i>The two of us are one</i>

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:14.610
No, Shirabe!

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:17.670
<i>Let's bring our bonds together...</i>

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:15.930
You need to let him get away, or...

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:24.010
...you'll have a huge accident!

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:31.020
I instinctively used my clone technique.

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:34.730
You have power.

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:36.700
Now you must learn to use it.

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:41.340
Shirabe-chan!

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:44.500
Shirabe, are you okay?

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:49.280
<i>That's how I used to be...</i>

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:57.320
We've tried all of the Wielders' 
possible unison patterns.

00:04:57.320 --> 00:05:02.270
Shirabe-san is the only one unable to increase 
her phonic gain through teamwork.

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:05.240
This was unexpected.

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:10.350
Commander, a message from the Cabinet.

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:11.250
Put them through.

00:05:13.050 --> 00:05:14.570
Brother Yatsuhiro.

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:16.000
Did something happen?

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.950
<i>Yeah. I've got information for 
you from the Jinja Honchou.</i>

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:22.360
Jinja Honchou, so...

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:25.190
It may have to do with the 
ley line observatories.

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:29.560
<i>They speak of a gate from 
which gods appear...</i>

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:35.990
Gods... The power sought by 
the Bavarian Illuminati.

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:39.420
<i>I'll have you ask the details directly.</i>

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:42.040
<i>I'm sending the data you need.</i>

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:47.220
What will do we do, commander?

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:52.030
We may need a change of pace.

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:02.020
Tsuki Shrine in Saitama?

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:03.720
Is there something there?

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:08.710
<i>Many shrines are located on ley lines,
 and this is no exception.</i>

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:12.940
<i>And if there are any legends of the 
gate from which gods appear...</i>

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:16.140
So we're trying to find out 
more on our enemy's goals,

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:18.720
so we can turn the tables.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:25.140
You sure have a lot of energy, 
considering that we just finished training.

00:06:25.140 --> 00:06:28.070
Aww, are you trying to seduce me?

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:30.000
Why the hell would you think that?

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:43.700
How do you read that name?

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:48.500
They said it's Tsukuyomi Shirabe.

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:50.520
Shirabe...

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:52.970
Like Yajirobei! What a cool name!

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:56.300
I can't remember my real name...

00:06:56.310 --> 00:07:00.690
Good Luck Charm

00:06:56.310 --> 00:07:00.690
<b>Name</b>

00:06:56.930 --> 00:07:00.700
They gave it to me because 
of the things I had with me.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:05.150
They made my birthday the day I came here!

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.800
We've got something in common,
 so let's be friends!

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:09.100
Shirabe!

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:12.060
What's wrong, Shirabe?

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:15.200
Are you getting carsick because 
you're not riding on a saw?

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:18.030
No, it's nothing.

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:31.430
This place has bunnies instead of komainu!

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:46.220
Bunnies everywhere!

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:47.330
So cute!

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:50.360
I was told about you...

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:54.630
But you're all so very young!

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:57.990
Are you the priest here?

00:07:58.520 --> 00:07:59.770
Yes.

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:05.800
When I look at you all, I remember my grandchild, 
whose parents died in an accident.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:11.170
If she were alive, she'd be exactly your age!

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:16.960
Hey, we're all very 
different ages, you know!

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:19.020
Don't be stupid!

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:21.580
I was just kidding.

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:24.330
Just a little shrine humor for you.

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:27.730
You need humor if you're going 
to get along with other people.

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:35.520
We've never met, but now I believe 
we've opened up to each other.

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:40.500
Actually, I think you just built 
a great wall of distrust.

00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:44.140
Okay, let's get to the point.

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:51.490
Are you at all familiar with 
the Hikawa Shrine Group?

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:57.540
Is this... the constellation of Orion?

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:04.110
It's actually the Hikawa Shrines, 
including this one,

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:07.640
arranged in the exact manner 
of the constellation of Orion.

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:10.860
According to the legends 
that were passed down,

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:17.490
divine power shall appear from a gate
 called the Tsuzumiboshi no Kamudo.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:21.450
It's nothing but conjecture and hypothesis,

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:26.120
but it matches in many ways with the 
goals of the Bavarian Illuminati,

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.760
and cannot be ignored.

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:32.460
The gate from which gods appear...

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:36.700
You're being very loud!

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:42.180
I'm trying to be very serious, 
but there's a beast inside me, you see...

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:45.650
I'll start on dinner, then.

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:48.380
My quiche is delicious, you know?

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:50.470
Shouldn't you make Japanese food?

00:09:50.470 --> 00:09:52.010
This is a shrine.

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:54.100
I appreciate it, but...

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:58.090
If you want to read all 
the ancient scrolls here,

00:09:58.090 --> 00:10:01.310
you need a full belly's worth of energy...

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:10.680
That fool...

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:14.680
That former fraud... tried to show-off.
 That's how this happened.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:27.300
The missing energy needed for the placement 
of the altar will be synthesized from us.

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:32.950
I cannot accept Adam's willingness 
to sacrifice his comrades.

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:36.900
There must be something else he's hiding!

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:40.040
Well, it's just a girl's intuition, though.

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:43.230
A girl's intuition, huh?

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:50.180
Listen to you. You only 
became a girl late in life,

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:52.960
so that you could have a 
biologically perfect body.

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:59.480
But it's worth finding out for sure.

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:05.490
<i>The power of the gods, 
emanating from a gate?</i>

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.180
With everyone's help,

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:11.640
we were able to learn several things 
from the ancient scrolls at the shrine.

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:15.900
<i>If the enemy is working on a 
plan involving the ley lines...</i>

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:18.810
<i>To fight it, we'll need a keystone.</i>

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:20.760
A keystone...

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:24.500
Several of them were lost 
in the battle with Carol.

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:28.080
But they should still function as 
a safety valve for the ley lines.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.650
We can't let the Illuminati 
have the divine power!

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:35.570
We'll stop them, no matter what it takes!

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:37.870
Of course, that's the plan.

00:11:43.330 --> 00:11:44.820
Oh, my.

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:48.030
A walk at this hour?

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:53.360
Is something bothering you?

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:55.310
I can figure it out on my own.

00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:58.680
Still, you'll feel better 
if you talk about it.

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:01.230
No man is an island, after all.

00:12:01.230 --> 00:12:02.780
I know that!

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:05.420
But, I...

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:09.760
This is a shrine, you know?

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:13.960
It's the perfect place to talk 
if you're having problems.

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:34.410
I suppose this isn't something the 
younger generation is familiar with.

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:37.970
It's kind of... a pain.

00:12:37.970 --> 00:12:40.040
Oh, my.

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:42.230
Rules, traditions...

00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:45.390
I don't really understand what it means 
to have to change yourself to get along

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:46.790
with someone or something else.

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:01.660
Even if I want to, it doesn't work.

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:05.630
The only relationships I understand 
are the ones in my tiny, little world.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:11.710
My sense of inferiority is creating walls 
that drive away the people I care about.

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:15.810
Someday, I know they'll drive 
away my best friend...

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:25.820
You're a good person.

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:27.610
A good person?

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:30.420
Then why are there walls within me?

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:35.380
Perhaps it's important to destroy 
those walls and open up to others.

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:43.080
But walls do not exist solely 
to keep people out, I believe.

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:50.260
Hey, I want to be human!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:54.090
Well, that's sudden. 
More sudden than usual.

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:56.150
I'm saying that, when we get
 the power of the gods,

00:13:56.150 --> 00:13:59.340
I want to be a human like you!

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:03.830
I can't marry you as a doll, can I?

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:06.310
I want to have kids! Lots of kids!

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:08.780
I'll make a baseball team!

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:14.790
So turn those third-rate alchemists 
into life energy already, and...

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:18.670
I want to hear more about that.

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:24.880
You've heard it many times.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:28.560
Don't even try to tell me you don't know.

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:33.860
Your life, and Saint Germain's life,

00:14:33.860 --> 00:14:39.260
were intended to be sacrificed for 
the sake of the plan from the start.

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:42.050
I'd never heard that!

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:47.080
What else are you hiding?

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:49.120
What is your goal?

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:54.080
The power of the gods lies in
 the dream seen by the doll...

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:56.930
The doll?

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:14.640
She ran!

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:17.110
She's going to tell Saint Germain!

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:18.130
What do we do?

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:23.290
We'll let the Symphogears flush them out.

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:28.420
<i>Saint Germain! Saint Germain!</i>

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:31.860
<i>I'm being jammed!</i>

00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:35.090
An alchemist?

00:15:35.090 --> 00:15:38.080
She's heading north at high speed 
along the Shin-Kawagoe Bypass!

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.910
Heavy damage to the surrounding area!

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.510
If she makes it to a residential area...

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:45.200
Roger. We'll deal with it.

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:46.960
Where are you all going?

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:50.810
Shirabe...

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:53.770
Master! Shirabe-chan just...

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:56.730
A helicopter is on its way!

00:15:56.730 --> 00:15:59.150
Don't rush off! Wait for it!

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:02.220
<i>I can catch up to her
 with the Shul Shagana.</i>

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:11.620
You're not the only one who's fast!

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:23.740
What are you planning?
 Where are you going?

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:25.870
I don't have time for you!

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:37.800
She doesn't care about us, huh?

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:40.970
We'll use Unison, Tsukuyomi!

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:44.550
We can catch up using an 
Ignite Double Boost maneuver!

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:48.540
I can't use the Unison...

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:49.740
Tsukuyomi!

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:54.420
Kiri-chan can do it, 
no matter who she works with.

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:55.930
But I...

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:57.430
I can only do it with her!

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:00.690
I don't know how to deal with other people.

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:02.840
I have to become strong on my own!

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:04.000
On my own...

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:08.340
You have walls around your heart, don't you?

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:10.630
Walls...

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:24.290
I once had a heart that cared for a friend 
I lost, and refused to lose any more.

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:25.940
It became a wall that blinded me.

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:29.700
She means Amou Kanade-san?

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:34.160
But your walls aren't 
walls to keep others out!

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:37.000
You distance yourself from others
 because you care about them!

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:40.330
Because I care about them?

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:47.210
I'm sure that's a sign of your kindness...

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:49.290
Kindness...

00:17:58.050 --> 00:18:01.530
It's not me who's kind. 
It's the people around me!

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:04.340
That's why you're looking out for me...

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:07.680
I want to be as nice as you all are to me!

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:11.900
Shut up! Just stop following me around!

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:17.770
Gotcha...

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:19.180
<i>Dáinsleif...</i>

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:21.650
What the hell?

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:27.550
She's heading straight for 
the residential area!

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.930
Let's begin the battle!

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:38.760
Don't get in my way!

00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:44.960
<i>The reason I run up this path</i>

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:46.940
They're matching me move for move!

00:18:44.960 --> 00:18:50.280
<i>Even if the headwinds try 
to protect it from me</i>

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:55.170
<i>Let us go forward, 
remembering to sing together</i>

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:54.660
I won't let you create 
the power of the gods!

00:18:54.660 --> 00:18:57.060
I want the same thing!

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:58.740
<i>The tears you only notice 
after you've lost them</i>

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:02.140
<i>Are the height of impermanence</i>

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:07.310
<i>You can go anywhere if you 
notice your invisible wings</i>

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:13.200
<i>Going forward, inheriting the
 wings of words dancing in the sky</i>

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:11.450
You singers need some waves to cool you off!

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:13.210
You're trying to close our path?

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:18.190
<i>Connecting it to the courage that 
lies beyond the wall you surpass</i>

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:16.130
We'll just slice it open again!

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:23.340
<i>The love you want to live up 
to, the gentleness you share</i>

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:29.050
<i>Let's be a roaring wind that 
heads towards the future</i>

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:29.060
What the hell?!

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:34.000
<i>Burning with the power to 
support and guide someone</i>

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:33.730
We're heading through it!

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:39.150
<i>The true meaning of becoming 
strong on your own</i>

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:45.360
<i>Let it light up this song without a melody</i>

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:41.570
<b>Twin Rush of the Wind and Moon</b>

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:44.580
I have to tell Saint Germain!

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:48.700
I can't die here!

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:55.200
<i>It felt like we met each other 
to live through this moment</i>

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:57.470
I need to tell Saint Germain 
that Adam is dangerous!

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:57.960
<i>You taught me</i>

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.460
<i>And I learned from you</i>

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:06.380
<i>Let this melody of bonds explode</i>

00:20:06.110 --> 00:20:09.350
Saint Germain! Saint Germain!

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:14.760
Did we win?

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:17.860
Yeah. We claimed victory together.

00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:37.210
<i>Prelati got run over like a frog!</i>

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:38.480
<i>The perfect end for her!</i>

00:20:39.360 --> 00:20:42.790
<i>She couldn't even be a sacrifice. 
What a worthless death, huh?</i>

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:44.470
<i>Pathetic, huh?</i>

00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:49.880
<i>Her report is correct. Unfortunately.</i>

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:52.600
She went out on her own?

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:55.150
<i>Return immediately,</i>

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:58.690
<i>before the Symphogears notice the ritual.</i>

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:04.970
Cagliostro first, and then Prelati?

00:22:39.760 --> 00:22:41.530
Thank you for everything!

00:22:41.530 --> 00:22:44.430
Not at all. Was I able to help you?

00:22:44.430 --> 00:22:47.040
You helped a lot!

00:22:47.040 --> 00:22:49.620
You started reading and 
immediately fell asleep...

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:51.660
Then, that alchemist was heading to...

00:22:49.620 --> 00:22:51.790
You found me out?

00:22:51.660 --> 00:22:55.140
<i>One of the shrines that match 
the Orion constellation.</i>

00:22:55.140 --> 00:22:57.850
There's a ley point there.

00:22:58.200 --> 00:23:00.810
This is seeming more and more plausible.

00:23:01.260 --> 00:23:03.840
It may be time to do something about this.

00:23:04.410 --> 00:23:07.920
Come back to Tsuki Shrine if you like.

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:10.410
While this old man is still alive, please.

00:23:10.720 --> 00:23:13.660
A shrine joke, huh? Not funny...

00:23:14.610 --> 00:23:15.800
Take this.

00:23:21.070 --> 00:23:23.250
Thank you!

00:23:27.490 --> 00:23:29.370
It's so strange...

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:32.590
You definitely don't read 
this kanji as "Tsuki."

00:23:32.990 --> 00:23:35.560
Kiri-chan, we'll leave you 
behind if you don't hurry!

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:38.340
I-I'm coming!

00:23:38.270 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Tsuki (Shirabe) Shrine</b>
